msgid "Give an image avatar a meaningful `alt` (the person's name), not a generic \"avatar\"; for initials-only avatars, prefer real name content (bare text, data-initials, .name, or .first-name/.last-name) over pre-abbreviated letters, so assistive tech announces the real name."
msgstr ""

#: css/avatar.md
