#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`-placement-end` and the default (start) both use `flex-direction`/`inset-inline-*` logical properties, not `left`/`right`, so the tray's side follows `direction`/`dir=\"rtl\"` automatically — no separate RTL rules are needed."
msgstr ""

