#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- You need a prominent page header with visual hierarchy\n- The page benefits from a large, eye-catching opening section\n- You want to include background imagery or gradient accents\n🚫 Don't use Hero when:"
