msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wire a close button to dismiss its target."
msgstr "Connectar un botó de tancament per descartar el seu objectiu."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initCloseButton.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Target resolution (first match wins):\n1. `data-close-target=\"id\"` — dismiss the element with that id\n2. `popovertarget` / `commandfor` — skip; native browser handles it\n3. walk up to the nearest `<dialog>`, `[popover]`, or `[data-dismissible]`"
msgstr "Resolució de l'objectiu (guanya la primera coincidència):\n1. `data-close-target=\"id\"` — descartar l'element amb aquest id\n2. `popovertarget` / `commandfor` — saltar; el navegador natiu ho gestiona\n3. pujar fins al més proper `&lt;dialog&gt;`, `[popover]`, o `[data-dismissible]`"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initCloseButton.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Dismiss strategy:\n- `<dialog>` → `dialog.close()`\n- `[popover]` → `el.hidePopover()`\n- `[data-dismissible]` or `[open]` → remove open attr + fire bubbling `close`"
msgstr "Estratègia de descart:\n- `&lt;dialog&gt;` → `dialog.close()`\n- `[popover]` → `el.hidePopover()`\n- `[data-dismissible]` o `[open]` → eliminar atribut obert + disparar `close` emergent"

