msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wire a contenteditable field for click-to-edit commit/revert behaviour.\nEnter commits, Escape reverts; blur also commits if the value changed.\nFires a bubbling `change` CustomEvent with `detail.value` on commit."
msgstr "Connectar un camp editable per a comportament de commit/revert de fer clic per editar.\nEntrar fa commit, Escape reverteix; desenfocar també fa commit si el valor ha canviat.\nDispara un CustomEvent `change` emergent amb `detail.value` en commit."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initInPlaceEdit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "  CSS:  host = .instui-in-place-edit element (which IS contenteditable)\n  WC:   host = shadow .instui-in-place-edit span"
msgstr "  CSS:  host = element .instui-in-place-edit (que SÍ que és contenteditable)\n  WC:   host = shadow span .instui-in-place-edit"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initInPlaceEdit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
