msgstr "### dispatchOn"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initModal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: initModal()"
msgstr "# Funció: initModal()"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initModal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wire a CSS `<dialog class=\"instui-modal\">` or a web component's shadow\n`<dialog>` to the `open` attribute protocol and `--show/--close/--toggle`\ncommand routing. Both usages pass the same interface:"
msgstr "Connectar un `<dialog class=\"instui-modal\">` CSS o el shadow `<dialog>` d'un component web al protocol d'atribut `open` i l'enrutament de comandos `--show/--close/--toggle`. Tots dos usos passen la mateixa interfície:"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initModal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- CSS: `host === dialog` (the dialog itself carries the id and open attr)\n- WC: `host` = custom element, `dialog` = its shadow `<dialog>`"
msgstr "- CSS: `host === dialog` (el diàleg en si porta l'id i l'atribut obert)\n- WC: `host` = element personalitzat, `dialog` = el seu shadow `&lt;dialog&gt;`"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initModal.md
