msgstr "# Funció: resolveSpace()"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/resolveSpace.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Resolve one spacing value: keyword alias to token, otherwise pass through unchanged."
msgstr "Resol un valor d'espaiat: alias de paraula clau al testimoni, en cas contrari passa sense canvis."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/spacingValue.md
#, no-c-format
