msgid "One entry of the pantoken spacing scale: the short key, the long (word) key, and the shared CSS value."
msgstr "Una entrada de l'escala d'espaiat pantoken: la clau curta, la clau llarga (paraula), i el valor CSS compartit."

#: packages/utils/src/interfaces/SpacingStep.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### short"
msgstr "### short"

#: packages/utils/src/interfaces/SpacingStep.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The short scale key, e.g. `\"sm\"` (the zero step's short key is `\"0\"`)."
msgstr "La clau d'escala curta, p. ex. `\"sm\"` (la clau curta del pas zero és `\"0\"`)."

#: packages/utils/src/interfaces/SpacingStep.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### long"
msgstr "### long"

#: packages/utils/src/interfaces/SpacingStep.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The long, word-spelled key, e.g. `\"small\"` (the zero step's long key is `\"none\"`)."
msgstr "La clau llarga, escrita amb paraules, p. ex. `\"small\"` (la clau llarga del pas zero és `\"none\"`)."

#: packages/utils/src/interfaces/SpacingStep.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The CSS value — a token reference, or a plain `\"0\"`/`\"auto\"`."
msgstr "El valor CSS — una referència de token, o un simple `\"0\"`/`\"auto\"`."

#: packages/utils/src/interfaces/TokenUtilityGroup.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: TokenUtilityGroup"
msgstr "# Interfície: TokenUtilityGroup"

#: packages/utils/src/interfaces/TokenUtilityGroup.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A set of tokens that all map to one CSS property (e.g. every `--instui-font-weight-*` → `font-weight`)."
msgstr "Un conjunt de tokens que tots es mapegen a una propietat CSS (p. ex. tots `--instui-font-weight-*` → `font-weight`)."

#: packages/utils/src/interfaces/TokenUtilityGroup.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### property"
msgstr "### property"

#: packages/utils/src/interfaces/TokenUtilityGroup.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The CSS property the tokens set (e.g. `\"font-weight\"`, `\"border-radius\"`, `\"box-shadow\"`)."
msgstr "La propietat CSS que estableixen els tokens (p. ex. `\"font-weight\"`, `\"border-radius\"`, `\"box-shadow\"`)."

#: packages/utils/src/interfaces/TokenUtilityGroup.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Full token names (e.g. `\"--instui-font-weight-body-strong\"`); the `--instui-` tail becomes the class."
msgstr "Noms complets dels tokens (p. ex. `\"--instui-font-weight-body-strong\"`); la part final `--instui-` es converteix en la classe."

#: packages/utils/src/interfaces/UtilityOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: UtilityOptions"
msgstr "# Interfície: UtilityOptions"

#: packages/utils/src/interfaces/UtilityOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options shared by the utility-class emitters."
msgstr "Opcions compartides pels emissors de classes d'utilitat."

#: packages/utils/src/interfaces/UtilityOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The class prefix. Any truthy string namespaces every class (`\"instui\"` → `.instui-bg-…`); any\nfalsy value (`null`/`undefined`/`\"\"`) drops the prefix entirely (`.bg-…`)."
msgstr "El prefix de classe. Qualsevol cadena veritable estableix un namespace per a cada classe (`\"instui\"` → `.instui-bg-…`); qualsevol valor fals (`null`/`undefined`/`\"\"`) elimina completament el prefix (`.bg-…`)."

#: packages/utils/src/type-aliases/ColorUtilityEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Type Alias: ColorUtilityEntry"
msgstr "# Àlies de tipus: ColorUtilityEntry"

#: packages/utils/src/type-aliases/ColorUtilityEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "One semantic colour family entry: a bare name (resolved against `--instui-color-<family>-<name>`)\n or an explicit `[name, value]` pair — the second element is `var()`-wrapped if it's a `--custom-prop`\n name, or used verbatim otherwise (a `light-dark(…)` expression, a raw keyword like `transparent`)."
msgstr "Una entrada de família de color semàntica: un nom senzill (resolt contra `--instui-color-&lt;family&gt;-&lt;name&gt;`) o un parell `[name, value]` explícit — el segon element està envoltant-lo amb `var()` si és un nom `--custom-prop`, o s'utilitza literalment en cas contrari (una expressió `light-dark(…)`, una paraula clau crua com `transparent`)."

#: packages/utils/src/variables/LIGHT_DARK_RE.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: LIGHT\\_DARK\\_RE"
msgstr "# Variable: LIGHT\\_DARK\\_RE"

#: packages/utils/src/variables/LIGHT_DARK_RE.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A `light-dark(<light>, <dark>)` value; capture groups 1 and 2 are the two branches."
msgstr "Un valor `light-dark(&lt;light&gt;, &lt;dark&gt;)`; els grups de captura 1 i 2 són les dues branques."

#: packages/utils/src/variables/SPACING_AUTO_STEP.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: SPACING\\_AUTO\\_STEP"
msgstr "# Variable: SPACING\\_AUTO\\_STEP"

#: packages/utils/src/variables/SPACING_AUTO_STEP.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `auto` step — margin only, spelled the same both ways."
msgstr "El pas `auto` — només marge, escrit igual de les dues formes."

#: packages/utils/src/variables/SPACING_STEPS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: SPACING\\_STEPS"
msgstr "# Variable: SPACING\\_STEPS"

#: packages/utils/src/variables/SPACING_STEPS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The pantoken spacing scale, `none`/`0` → `2xl` — the single shared source for\n`@pantoken/components`' spacing/gap utilities and `@pantoken/interactions`' `resolveSpace`, so the\ntwo never drift apart."
msgstr "L'escala d'espaiat de pantoken, `none`/`0` → `2xl` — la font compartida única per a les utilitats d'espaiat/buit de `@pantoken/components` i el `resolveSpace` de `@pantoken/interactions`, de manera que els dos mai es desviïn."

#: packages/utils/src/variables/VAR_RE.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: VAR\\_RE"
msgstr "# Variable: VAR\\_RE"

#: packages/utils/src/variables/VAR_RE.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A `var(--custom-prop)` reference (optional fallback); capture group 1 is the property name."
msgstr "Una referència `var(--custom-prop)` (substitut opcional); el grup de captura 1 és el nom de la propietat."

#: platforms/android/src/functions/generateAndroid.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: generateAndroid()"
msgstr "# Funció: generateAndroid()"

#: platforms/android/src/functions/generateAndroid.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Emit Android resource XML for a named theme (using the vendored `@pantoken/tokens` IR)."
msgstr "Emeteri XML de recursos Android per a un tema nomenat (utilitzant la `@pantoken/tokens` IR fornida)."

#: platforms/android/src/functions/generateAndroid.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The paths of the written `colors.xml` and `dimens.xml`."
msgstr "Els camins dels `colors.xml` i `dimens.xml` escrits."

#: platforms/android/src/functions/toAndroid.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: toAndroid()"
msgstr "# Funció: toAndroid()"

#: platforms/android/src/functions/toAndroid.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Emit Android resource XML for an explicit token IR."
msgstr "Emeteri XML de recursos Android per a una IR de token explícita."

#: platforms/android/src/functions/toAndroid.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Emit a specific theme's IR**"
msgstr "**Emeteri la IR d'un tema específic**"

#: platforms/android/src/functions/toAndroid.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Dark mode with icon VectorDrawables**"
msgstr "**Mode fosc amb VectorDrawables d'icones**"

#: platforms/android/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# android"
msgstr "# android"

#: platforms/android/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/android` — emit Instructure design tokens as Android resource XML."
msgstr "`@pantoken/android` — emeteri els tokens de disseny d'Instructure com XML de recursos Android."

#: platforms/android/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It flattens the IR to concrete, single-mode values (`@pantoken/core`'s `toStyleDictionary`), then\nemits `res/values/colors.xml` (colour tokens) and `res/values/dimens.xml` (dimension tokens) via\n`@pantoken/sd-config`. Style Dictionary applies the Android transforms (`#aarrggbb`, `dp`/`sp`)."
msgstr "Aplaneix la IR a valors concrets de mode únic (`toStyleDictionary` de `@pantoken/core`), després emeteri `res/values/colors.xml` (tokens de color) i `res/values/dimens.xml` (tokens de dimensió) a través de `@pantoken/sd-config`. Style Dictionary aplica les transformacions d'Android (`#aarrggbb`, `dp`/`sp`)."

#: platforms/android/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [generateAndroid](functions/generateAndroid.md)"
msgstr "Reanomena i reexporta [generateAndroid](functions/generateAndroid.md)"

#: platforms/android/src/interfaces/GenerateAndroidOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: GenerateAndroidOptions"
msgstr "# Interfície: GenerateAndroidOptions"

#: platforms/android/src/interfaces/GenerateAndroidOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [generateAndroid](../functions/generateAndroid.md) / [toAndroid](../functions/toAndroid.md)."
msgstr "Opcions per a [generateAndroid](../functions/generateAndroid.md) / [toAndroid](../functions/toAndroid.md)."

#: platforms/android/src/interfaces/GenerateAndroidOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### outDir"
msgstr "### outDir"

#: platforms/android/src/interfaces/GenerateAndroidOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The output directory; files are written under `<outDir>/res/values`."
msgstr "El directori de sortida; els fitxers s'escriuen sota `&lt;outDir&gt;/res/values`."

#: platforms/android/src/interfaces/GenerateAndroidOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The theme to emit (default: `\"rebrand\"`)."
msgstr "El tema per emeteri (per defecte: `\"rebrand\"`)."

#: platforms/android/src/interfaces/GenerateAndroidOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Which `light-dark()` mode to resolve (default: `\"light\"`)."
msgstr "Quin mode `light-dark()` resoldre (per defecte: `\"light\"`)."

#: platforms/android/src/interfaces/GenerateAndroidOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Icon names to also emit as VectorDrawables under `res/drawable` (default: none)."
msgstr "Noms d'icones per emeteri també com a VectorDrawables sota `res/drawable` (per defecte: cap)."

