#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/functions/defaultThemeCssAssets.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: defaultThemeCssAssets()"
msgstr "# Funció: defaultThemeCssAssets()"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/functions/defaultThemeCssAssets.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The component-style sheets for a given theme/mode pair (token sheet plus the constant set)."
msgstr "Els full d'estils de component per a un parell tema/mode donat (full de tokens més el conjunt constant)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# canvas-theme-editor"
msgstr "# canvas-theme-editor"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/canvas-theme-editor` — upload-ready `theme.css`/`theme.js` for Canvas LMS's Theme\nEditor, pre-wired to pantoken's CDN-hosted CSS. Consumed by `@pantoken/scaffold`'s\n`canvas-theme-editor` platform; also usable standalone."
msgstr "`@pantoken/canvas-theme-editor` — `theme.css`/`theme.js` llest per pujar a l'Editor de Temes de Canvas LMS, pre-cablejat al CSS allotjat a CDN de pantoken. Consumit per la plataforma `canvas-theme-editor` de `@pantoken/scaffold`; també utilizable de manera independent."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`THEME_CSS`/`THEME_JS` are the jsDelivr-default, unpinned output — use [buildTheme](functions/buildTheme.md) to\ntarget a different CDN provider, pin a version, or swap in other pantoken/third-party assets."
msgstr "`THEME_CSS`/`THEME_JS` és la sortida per defecte de jsDelivr sense anclar — utilitza [buildTheme](functions/buildTheme.md) per dirigir-se a un proveïdor de CDN diferent, anclar una versió, o intercanviar altres actius de pantoken/tercers."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: BuildThemeOptions"
msgstr "# Interfície: BuildThemeOptions"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [buildTheme](../functions/buildTheme.md)/[buildThemeCss](../functions/buildThemeCss.md)/[buildThemeJs](../functions/buildThemeJs.md)."
msgstr "Opcions per a [buildTheme](../functions/buildTheme.md)/[buildThemeCss](../functions/buildThemeCss.md)/[buildThemeJs](../functions/buildThemeJs.md)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### provider?"
msgstr "### provider?"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The CDN provider to build URLs for. Defaults to jsDelivr when omitted."
msgstr "El proveïdor de CDN per al qual construir URL. Per defecte a jsDelivr si s'omet."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### version?"
msgstr "### version?"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Pins the version for every asset below that doesn't specify its own `version`."
msgstr "Ancla la versió per a cada actiu següent que no especifiqui el seu `version`."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Token theme variant. Defaults to `\"rebrand\"`. Ignored when `css` is supplied."
msgstr "Variant de tema de token. Per defecte `\"rebrand\"`. Ignorat quan es proporciona `css`."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Rebrand token mode. Defaults to `\"light\"`. Ignored outside the `rebrand` theme, or when `css` is supplied."
msgstr "Mode de token de rebranding. Per defecte `\"light\"`. Ignorat fora del tema `rebrand`, o quan es proporciona `css`."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### css?"
msgstr "### css?"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Component-style sheets. Defaults to [defaultThemeCssAssets](../functions/defaultThemeCssAssets.md) for `theme`/`mode`."
msgstr "Fulls d'estils de component. Per defecte [defaultThemeCssAssets](../functions/defaultThemeCssAssets.md) per a `theme`/`mode`."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### fonts?"
msgstr "### fonts?"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Font sheet(s). Defaults to [DEFAULT\\_THEME\\_FONT\\_ASSETS](../variables/DEFAULT_THEME_FONT_ASSETS.md)."
msgstr "Full/s de font. Per defecte [DEFAULT\\_THEME\\_FONT\\_ASSETS](../variables/DEFAULT_THEME_FONT_ASSETS.md)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### js?"
msgstr "### js?"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Script(s). Defaults to [DEFAULT\\_THEME\\_JS\\_ASSETS](../variables/DEFAULT_THEME_JS_ASSETS.md)."
msgstr "Script/s. Per defecte [DEFAULT\\_THEME\\_JS\\_ASSETS](../variables/DEFAULT_THEME_JS_ASSETS.md)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### strings?"
msgstr "### strings?"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Translated comment strings. Defaults to [ENGLISH\\_THEME\\_STRINGS](../variables/ENGLISH_THEME_STRINGS.md)."
msgstr "Cadenes de comentaris traduïdes. Per defecte [ENGLISH\\_THEME\\_STRINGS](../variables/ENGLISH_THEME_STRINGS.md)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: CdnFile"
msgstr "# Interfície: CdnFile"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A single file to load from a CDN, identified by npm package name and path within it."
msgstr "Un fitxer únic per carregar des d'una CDN, identificat pel nom del paquet npm i el camí dins d'ell."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### package"
msgstr "### package"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The npm package name, e.g. `\"@pantoken/components\"`."
msgstr "El nom del paquet npm, p. ex. `\"@pantoken/components\"`."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The path within the package, e.g. `\"dist/components.css\"`. Omit to reference the package root."
msgstr "La ruta dins del paquet, p. ex. `\"dist/components.css\"`. Omet-ho per fer referència a l'arrel del paquet."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Overrides the provider/build-level version for this file only."
msgstr "Sobrescriu la versió de nivell de proveïdor/construcció només per a aquest fitxer."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### raw?"
msgstr "### raw?"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "For providers that transform JS by default (esm.sh): `false` lets the provider apply its normal\nESM transform (needed to `import` a real package entry point). Defaults to `true` — serve the\nfile verbatim, required for prebuilt/non-ESM assets like CSS sheets and IIFE bundles."
msgstr "Per a proveïdors que transformen JS per defecte (esm.sh): `false` permet que el proveïdor apliqui la seva transformació\nESM normal (necessari per `import` un punt d'entrada de paquet real). Per defecte `true` — serveix el\nfitxer literalment, necessari per als actius preconstructed/no-ESM com ara full CSS i grups IIFE."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: CdnProvider"
msgstr "# Interfície: CdnProvider"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A CDN that can serve npm package files. Providers never hardcode a package name — they only\nknow how to shape a URL from a [CdnFile](CdnFile.md)."
msgstr "Una CDN que pot servir fitxers de paquet npm. Els proveïdors mai no codifiquen un nom de paquet — només\nsaben com formar una URL a partir d'una [CdnFile](CdnFile.md)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### id"
msgstr "### id"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Stable identifier, e.g. `\"jsdelivr\"`."
msgstr "Identificador estable, p. ex. `\"jsdelivr\"`."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### label"
msgstr "### label"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Human-readable name, e.g. `\"jsDelivr\"`."
msgstr "Nom llegible per humans, p. ex. `\"jsDelivr\"`."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### supportsCombine"
msgstr "### supportsCombine"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Whether [CdnProvider.buildCombineUrl](#buildcombineurl) is implemented."
msgstr "Si [CdnProvider.buildCombineUrl](#buildcombineurl) està implementat."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### buildUrl()"
msgstr "### buildUrl()"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Builds the URL for a single file."
msgstr "Construeix l'URL per a un sol fitxer."

