#: platforms/email/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Email clients don't support CSS custom properties and often strip `<style>`, so tokens are fully\nresolved to concrete values for inline styling. Colours are hex; dimensions keep their `px` units.\nIcons are excluded. `light`/`dark` maps are keyed by camelCased token name."
msgstr "Els clients de correu no admeten propietats CSS personalitzades i sovint eliminen `&lt;style&gt;`, de manera que els tokens es resolen completament\na valors concrets per a estil integrat. Els colors són hexadecimals; les dimensions mantenen les seves unitats `px`.\nEls iconos s'exclouen. Els mapes `light`/`dark` es claven pel nom del token camelCased."

