#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The Sass partial (`_sass/pantoken.scss`), the plain stylesheet\n(`assets/css/pantoken.css`), and the prose stylesheet (`assets/css/pantoken-prose.css`)."
msgstr "La parcial Sass (`_sass/pantoken.scss`), la fulla d'estils plana\n(`assets/css/pantoken.css`), i la fulla d'estils de prosa (`assets/css/pantoken-prose.css`)."

