#: renderers/react-native/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/react-native` — Instructure design tokens as React Native `StyleSheet`-friendly\nobjects. React Native has no CSS variables, so tokens are fully resolved to concrete values:\ncolours stay hex strings, dimensions become numbers (dp), and icons are excluded."
msgstr "`@pantoken/react-native` — tokens de disseny de Instructure com a objectes amigables amb `StyleSheet`\nde React Native. React Native no té variables CSS, per la qual cosa els tokens es resolen completament a valors concrets:\nels colors es mantenen com a cadenes hex, les dimensions es converteixen en números (dp) i es exclouen les icones."

