#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "One documented CSS record: its base class plus everything derived from the CSS + doc comments."
msgstr "Un registre CSS documentat: la seva classe base més tot el que es deriva del CSS + comentaris de doc."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The record name from `@component`/`@utility`/`@rule`/`@declaration`/`@name`, e.g. `button`."
msgstr "El nom del registre de `@component`/`@utility`/`@rule`/`@declaration`/`@name`, p. ex. `button`."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### kind"
msgstr "### kind"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Which kind of CSS surface this documents (defaults to `component`)."
msgstr "Quin tipus de superfície CSS documenta (per defecte `component`)."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The base CSS selector — a class (`.button`), attribute (`[data-layout=\"x\"]`), ID (`#foo`),\n or shadow-DOM pseudo (`:host`) — inferred from the first bare-class rule or set explicitly via\n `@selector`. Always non-empty (falls back to `.${name}` when inference fails)."
msgstr "El selector CSS base — una classe (`.button`), atribut (`[data-layout=\"x\"]`), ID (`#foo`),\n o pseudo shadow-DOM (`:host`) — inferit de la primera regla de classe nua o establert explícitament via\n `@selector`. Sempre no buit (retorna a `.${name}` quan falla la inferència)."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### summary?"
msgstr "### summary?"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "One-line summary from `@summary`."
msgstr "Resum d'una línia de `@summary`."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### remarks?"
msgstr "### remarks?"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Extended prose from `@remarks`."
msgstr "Prosa estesa de `@remarks`."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### privateRemarks?"
msgstr "### privateRemarks?"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
