#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "AST-extracted sub-element parts (class-based), annotated with `@part` prose where authored."
msgstr "Parts de subelement extretes de l'AST (basades en classe), anotades amb prosa `@part` on es va crear."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### shadowParts"
msgstr "### shadowParts"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Shadow-DOM exposed parts (`::part(name)`), from `@csspart` or a `::part()` selector."
msgstr "Parts exposades de Shadow-DOM (`::part(name)`), de `@csspart` o un selector `::part()`."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### pseudoElements"
msgstr "### pseudoElements"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Native pseudo-elements the component styles (`::before`, `::marker`, …), from `@pseudo` or a selector."
msgstr "Pseudo-elements nadius que el component estilitza (`::before`, `::marker`, …), de `@pseudo` o un selector."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### states"
msgstr "### states"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
