msgid "The authored `@structure` element tree (top-level nodes), when present. When the `@structure` body\nuses `@variant` blocks (see [structureVariants](#structurevariants)), this holds the first variant's nodes only,\nfor back-compat with any code that hasn't been updated to read `structureVariants`."
msgstr "L'arbre d'elements `@structure` creat per l'autor (nodes de nivell superior), quan està present. Quan el cos `@structure`\nusa blocs `@variant` (vegeu [structureVariants](#structurevariants)), això conté només els nodes de la primera variant,\nper a compatibilitat enrere amb qualsevol codi que no s'ha actualitzat per llegir `structureVariants`."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### structureVariants?"
msgstr "### structureVariants?"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Alternative DOM shapes for this component, when the authored `@structure` body contains one or\nmore top-level `@variant` blocks — absent for the common case of a single, non-variant structure."
msgstr "Formes DOM alternatives per a aquest component, quan el cos `@structure` creat per l'autor conté un o\nmés blocs `@variant` de nivell superior — absent per al cas comú d'una estructura única sense variant."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### structureDescription?"
