msgstr "Accepts a fully resolved [LocaleBundle](../interfaces/LocaleBundle.md) *or* a raw BCP47 tag string. When a string is\npassed, [makeStrings](makeStrings.md) derives weekday names via `Intl.DateTimeFormat` and all other strings\nfall back to English; pass a bundle for full translations."

