#: renderers/web-components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# web-components"
msgstr "# web-components"

#: renderers/web-components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/web-components` — framework-agnostic custom elements for Instructure UI."
msgstr "`@pantoken/web-components` — elements personalitzats agnòstics del marc per a la interfície d'usuari d'Instructure."

#: renderers/web-components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "[register](functions/register.md) (auto-invoked in the browser) defines the full `<instui-*>` element set into\nany custom-element registry. Each element renders the matching `@pantoken/components` CSS into\nits shadow root; tokens are inherited custom properties that pierce the shadow boundary — load\n`@pantoken/css` to supply them."
msgstr "[register](functions/register.md) (auto-invocat al navegador) defineix el conjunt complet d'elements `<instui-*>` en qualsevol registre d'elements personalitzats. Cada element renderitza el `@pantoken/components` CSS coincident en la seva arrel d'ombra; els tokens són propietats personalitzades heretades que travessen el límit de l'ombra — carregeu `@pantoken/css` per a subministrar-los."

#: renderers/web-components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "For localized UI strings (calendar nav labels, date-input placeholder, drilldown Back text) pass\n`locale`, `strings`, or `dir` options to [register](functions/register.md). The full Canvas-parity bundle set and\nthe [registerLocalized](functions/registerLocalized.md) helper are exported from this package as well."
msgstr "For localized UI strings (calendar nav labels, date-input placeholder, drilldown Back text) pass\n`locale`, `strings`, or `dir` options to [register](functions/register.md). The full Canvas-parity bundle set and\nthe [registerLocalized](functions/registerLocalized.md) helper are exported from this package as well."

#: renderers/web-components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The module is Node-safe: element classes are defined inside [register](functions/register.md), a no-op when there\nis no DOM, so importing during SSR or a build never touches `HTMLElement`."
msgstr "El mòdul és segur per a Node: les classes d'elements es defineixen dins [register](functions/register.md), una no-op quan no hi ha DOM, de manera que importar durant SSR o una construcció mai no toca `HTMLElement`."

