msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: avatar"
msgstr "# Variable: avatar"

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/avatar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-avatar>` — a circular (or rectangular) avatar. `variant` maps to `-color-<variant>`,\n`size` to `-size-<size>`, and `shape=\"rectangle\"` to `-shape-rectangle`; slotted content is the\ninitials, or an `<img>` (use an absolute/CDN `src`) to show a photo."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-avatar&gt;` — un avatar circular (o rectangular). `variant` es mapeja a `-color-&lt;variant&gt;`, `size` a `-size-&lt;size&gt;`, i `shape=\"rectangle\"` a `-shape-rectangle`; el contingut amb slot són les inicials, o un `&lt;img&gt;` (utilitzeu una URL absoluta/CDN `src`) per mostrar una foto."

