msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: dateInput"
msgstr "# Variable: dateInput"

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/dateInput.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-date-input>` — a text field plus a calendar dropdown. The trigger toggles a `[popover]`\nthrough the built-in `toggle-popover` Invoker Command (a click fallback covers browsers without the\nAPI); picking a day in the nested `<instui-calendar>` fills the field (ISO `yyyy-mm-dd`), closes the\npopover, and emits a composed, bubbling `change` (`detail.value`). Typing a valid `yyyy-mm-dd` (or\nclearing it) and committing on the input's `change` works too. `value` is the ISO date, `label` the\naccessible name (default `Date`), and `placeholder` the hint (default `yyyy-mm-dd`)."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-date-input&gt;` — un camp de text més un desplegable de calendari. El disparador commuta un `[popover]` a través de l'ordre d'Invocador integrada `toggle-popover` (un retorn de clic cobreix navegadors sense l'API); triar un dia al `&lt;instui-calendar&gt;` imbricat omple el camp (ISO `yyyy-mm-dd`), tanca la finestra emergent i emet un `change` compost i bubbling (`detail.value`). Escriure un `yyyy-mm-dd` vàlid (o esborrar-lo) i confirmar en l'entrada `change` també funciona. `value` és la data ISO, `label` el nom accessible (per defecte `Date`), i `placeholder` la pista (per defecte `yyyy-mm-dd`)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/dateTimeInput.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: dateTimeInput"
msgstr "# Variable: dateTimeInput"

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/dateTimeInput.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-date-time-input>` — a nested `<instui-date-input>` plus a native time field. A change to\neither recomputes a combined `value` (`yyyy-mm-ddThh:mm`, or just the date when no time) and emits\na composed, bubbling `change` (`detail.value`). Setting `value` splits it back across the two\nfields."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-date-time-input&gt;` — un `&lt;instui-date-input&gt;` imbricat més un camp de temps natiu. Un canvi en qualsevol dels dos recomputa un `value` combinat (`yyyy-mm-ddThh:mm`, o només la data quan no hi ha hora) i emet un `change` compost i bubbling (`detail.value`). Establir `value` ho divideix de nou als dos camps."

