#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-img>` — a token-styled `<img>` built from `src`/`alt`. `constrain` maps to\n`-constrain-<value>` (e.g. `cover`, `contain`) and `display=\"block\"` to `-display-block`."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-img&gt;` — un `&lt;img&gt;` amb estil de token construït a partir de `src`/`alt`. `constrain` mapeja a `-constrain-&lt;value&gt;` (per exemple `cover`, `contain`) i `display=\"block\"` a `-display-block`."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/inPlaceEdit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: inPlaceEdit"
msgstr "# Variable: inPlaceEdit"

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/inPlaceEdit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-in-place-edit>` — a click-to-edit field. `value` shows as text; on click/focus it becomes\neditable, Enter or blur commits (and fires a bubbling `change` event with `detail.value`), and\nEscape reverts to the pre-edit value. `readonly` disables editing. An external `value` change\nreflects into the field while it isn't being edited."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-in-place-edit&gt;` — un camp editable amb clic. `value` es mostra com a text; en fer clic/focus es torna editable, Intro o desenfocar confirma (i dispara un event bubbling `change` amb `detail.value`), i Escape es reverteix al valor anterior a l'edició. `readonly` deshabilita l'edició. Un canvi `value` extern es reflecteix al camp mentre no se n'estigui editant."

