msgstr "# Variable: toggleButton"

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/toggleButton.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-toggle-button>` — a two-state button. `pressed=\"true\"` reflects to the button's\n`aria-pressed`; slotted content is the label."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-toggle-button&gt;` — un botó de dos estats. `pressed=\"true\"` es reflecteix al `aria-pressed` del botó; el contingut ranurat és l'etiqueta."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: tooltip"
msgstr "# Variable: tooltip"

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-tooltip>` — wraps a slotted trigger and shows a `.tip` bubble (from the `tip` attribute)\non hover/focus. `placement` maps to `-placement-<value>` (e.g. `bottom`, `end`); `show-delay` and\n`hide-delay` (ms, default 0) gate the reveal/hide, and Escape dismisses it. JS owns the timing:\na `.-show`-gated `!important` override neutralizes the pure-CSS `:hover`/`:focus-within` auto-show\nso the delay actually applies."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-tooltip&gt;` — embolcalla un activador ranurat i mostra una bombolla `.tip` (de l'atribut `tip`) en passar el ratolí/focus. `placement` es mapeja a `-placement-&lt;value&gt;` (p. ex. `bottom`, `end`); `show-delay` i `hide-delay` (ms, per defecte 0) controlen la revelació/ocultació, i Escape la descarta. JS controla el temps: una substitució `!important` controlada per `.-show` neutralitza l'automostra purament CSS `:hover`/`:focus-within`, de manera que la demora realment s'aplica."

