msgstr "Directori de font de demostració autoallotjat, relatiu a `base` (per defecte `demos/`)."

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/DemoMarkdownItOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### cssUrls?"
msgstr "### cssUrls?"

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/DemoMarkdownItOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Stylesheet URLs the runner injects (into its chrome and every rendered result): the component\nsheets, the multi-theme token sheet, and the plugin/surface sheets. The runner themes by toggling\nthe `data-pantoken-theme` attribute, so one token sheet covers every theme."
msgstr "URLs de full d'estil que el corredor injecta (al seu chrome i a cada resultat renderitzat): els fulls de component,\nel full de token de tema múltiple, i els fulls de connector/superfície. Els temes del corredor es controlen activant\nl'atribut `data-pantoken-theme`, de manera que un full de token cobreix tots els temes."

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/DemoMarkdownItOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### liveExample?"
msgstr "### liveExample?"

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/DemoMarkdownItOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "When set, appends a live preview after each `html` fence on matching pages — the same markup,\nrendered live, beneath its source. Overlay examples (`<dialog>`, `[popover]`) are skipped: they're\nhidden until opened, so a `## Demo` iframe drives their preview instead."
msgstr "Quan s'estableix, afegeix una vista prèvia en directe després de cada tanca `html` a les pàgines coincidents — el mateix codi,\nrenderitzat en directe, sota la seva font. Els exemples de superposició (`&lt;dialog&gt;`, `[popover]`) es salten: són\namagats fins que s'obren, de manera que un iframe `## Demo` impulsa la seva vista prèvia."

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/DemoMarkdownItOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### localePrefix?"
msgstr "### localePrefix?"

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/DemoMarkdownItOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Route a `demo:self:<name>` fence to a locale-specific self-hosted demo directory, from the current\npage's markdown-it `env.relativePath` (e.g. `\"hu/\"` for pages under `hu/`, `\"\"` for the root\nlocale). Prepended to `demosPath` so the localized clone of a demo (translated prose, same markup)\nloads instead of the English source. Omit for a single-locale site."
msgstr "Route a `demo:self:&lt;name&gt;` fence to a locale-specific self-hosted demo directory, from the current\npage's markdown-it `env.relativePath` (e.g. `\"hu/\"` for pages under `hu/`, `\"\"` for the root\nlocale). Prepended to `demosPath` so the localized clone of a demo (translated prose, same markup)\nloads instead of the English source. Omit for a single-locale site."

